\end{tcolorbox}
\caption{{From DUD to CAMS}} \label{fig-DUD}
\end{figure}


Then, the Bengio-Malkin's principle above becomes a conditional Bengio-Malkin's principle, following the steps in Figure \ref{fig-CAMS}. 

