\section{Existentially Constrained Terms}
\label{ssec:existentially cterms and equivalence}

In this subsection, we introduce our novel notion of existentially constrained terms,
and give the definition of their equivalence.
We start by giving the definition of existential constraints and then proceed
to existentially constrained terms in order to show their specific properties.


