       $\xM \vDash (\ECO{\vec{x}}{\varphi})\mu_X\theta \Leftrightarrow (\ECO{\vec{y}}{\psi})\mu_Y$, 
%        where $\tilde{X} = \hat{X} \cap X$ and $\tilde{Y} = \hat{Y}\cap Y$.
