    let ${\sim} = {\sim}_{\Pos_{X\cup \Val}(s)} = {\sim}_{\Pos_{X\cup \Val}(t)}$, 
    and $\mu_X,\mu_Y$ be representative substitutions of
     $\CTerm{X}{s}{\vec{x}}{\varphi}$ and $\CTerm{Y}{t}{\vec{y}}{\psi}$, respectively, 
    based on the same representative for
    each equivalence class $[p_i]_\sim$ ($1 \le i \le n$), and
    we have 
