and
$\Var(\varphi) 
= \FVar(\ECO{\vec{x}}{\varphi}) \cup \SET{\vec{x}}
\subseteq X \cup \SET{\vec{x}} = \SET{\vec{y}}$,
we have 
$\Var(\psi) \setminus \SET{\vec{y}} \subseteq  \SET{\seq{w}} = Y$,
and thus 
$\FVar(\ECO{\vec{y}}{\psi}) \subseteq Y$.
Moreover, as $t = s[w_1,\ldots,w_n]_{p_1,\ldots,p_n}$,
