W.l.o.g.\ suppose $X = \SET{x_1,\ldots,x_k}$,
$\Pos_X(s) =  \SET{p_1,\ldots,p_k }$ with $s|_{p_i} =  x_i$,
and $\Pos_{\Val}(s) =  \SET{p_{k+1},\ldots,p_n }$ with $s|_{p_i} = v_i$.
Then, for any valuation $\rho$, we have
\[
\begin{array}{rl}
& \vDash_{\xM,\rho} (\ECO{\vec{y}}{\psi})\sigma     \\
\iff& \vDash_{\xM,\rho} (\ECO{\vec{x},x_1,\ldots,x_k}{\varphi \land \bigwedge_{i=1}^n(s|_{p_i}=w_i)})\sigma       \\
