By \Cref{lem:equivalence-equals-to-symmetric-closure-of-subsumption} it suffices to
show that $\CTerm{X}{s}{}{\varphi} \mathrel{(\subsetsim \cap \supsetsim)} \CTerm{X \cup \Var(\pi)}{s}{}{\varphi \land \pi}$.
($\subsetsim$)    
Let $\sigma$ be an $X$-valued substitution such that $\sigma \vDash_{\xM} \varphi$.
Then we have 
$X \cup \Var(\varphi) \subseteq \VDom(\sigma)$ and $\vDash_{\xM} \varphi\sigma$.
%%
