$\vDash_{\xM,\gamma} \pi\kappa$, 
where $\kappa = \SET{ \vec{z} \mapsto \vec{v} }$.
As $\SET{\vec{z}} = \Var(\pi) \setminus (X \cup \Var(\varphi))$,
we have $\Var(\pi\kappa\sigma) = \varnothing$ and $\vDash_\xM \pi\kappa\sigma$.
%%
