The training-dataset is then formed by aggregating all possible pairs into set  $(\boldsymbol{X},\boldsymbol{Y})=\\(\tilde{\boldsymbol{\mathcal{H}}} ,\tilde{\Pv})|_{\Penv, \Psen}$ as depicted in the red-colored section of the input block in  Fig. \ref{fig:resnet}.
