In this section, we initially present the parameter values utilized for the training and evaluation of the proposed PRINN-based structure and describe the scenario for generating the vessel magnetic wake across various scenarios. Subsequently, we provide the numerical results of applying and evaluating the proposed PIRNN-based algorithm to estimate vessel parameters based on its magnetic wake. 

