\subsection{Parameters Setting and PIRNN Configuration}

As previously mentioned and illustrated in Fig. \ref{fig:airborne sensor}, in each training-dataset generation scenario, the airborne magnetic sensor intersects the vessel's trajectory at an angle $\alpha$ and samples the vessel magnetic wake along this trajectory.
