\subsection{Impact of Spike Encoding on Accuracy}
We further explored the effects of spike encoding. Table \ref{delta} shows the errors obtained from three encoding schemes in two platforms. Based on these results, it can be deduced that delta encoding can capture more dynamic changes and better encode spatiotemporal information.
