    automaton of \Cref{fig:qo-automata:example}.}
  \label{fig:strictly-increasing-paths}
  \begin{subfigure}{.4\textwidth}
    \caption{Two strictly increasing paths to the accepting state. They are
      minimal as soon as $a \preceq b \Rightarrow b \preceq a$ in $\alphabetQO$.}
