\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
where equality $\left(a\right)$ follows from $\langle \boldsymbol{x},\boldsymbol{y}\rangle=\frac{1}{2}(\|\boldsymbol{x}\|^2+\|\boldsymbol{y}\|^2-\|\boldsymbol{x}-\boldsymbol{y}\|^2)$. Then, we derive the upper bound of $X_B$.
