&\quad \left. + \sum\limits_{m=1}^M \left\|\nabla \mathcal{L}_m\left(\boldsymbol{w}^{t-1}\right) - \nabla\mathcal{L}_m\left(\boldsymbol{w}^{t-1}_m\right) \right\|^2  \right]\\
&- \quad \frac{\eta}{2} \mathbb{E}\left[\left\|\sum\limits_{m=1}^M \varphi_m \nabla \mathcal{L}\left(\boldsymbol{w}^{t-1}\right)\right\|^2\right]
