2\mathbb{E}\left[\frac{\sum\limits_{m=1}^M\left\|\left(\nabla \mathcal{L}(\boldsymbol{w}^{t-1}_m)-\nabla\mathcal{L}(\boldsymbol{w}^{t-1})\right)\right\|^2}{M}\right]\\&
