    \label{fig: lf_hf_comparison}
\end{figure}
In the subsequent examples in Section \ref{sec: porous_autoencoder} to \ref{sec: porous_costs}, we will continue to use the two LF model variants \lfb and \lfm as well as the HF porous media model to compare and highlight several aspects of BMFIA.

