It is to be noted that, the $\text{Li}_n$ series appearing in the expression of the analytic continuations of the $\mathrm{Li}_{2,2}(x, y)$  can be approximated using the Pad\'e approximation. However, those are evaluated with the inbuilt \mt commands.


